# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Minimization in a Python simulation on the CPU (D202), scenario
# cutoff-refusals of Inputs/python_minimize.py.
# Cutoff electrostatics in mixed precision, in one part and in parts of one
# step, against `mdir run`, and the refusals.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir %t cutoff-refusals | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: CPU Mixed, cutoff: one part of 20 steps:
# CHECK: minimization refusals passed
# CHECK: minimization cutoff-refusals passed
